ated in a secret and mythical realm  known as elysia which is an unexplored  land  inside a grand magic zone within the  heart  kingdom this place is just overflowing  with thick  and extremely powerful mana and the  surviving elves have been residing here  ever since the previous saga of the  story ended  and not only that but as he is  explaining the situation to the black  clover mages pawtry casually drops  a pretty massive reveal along with  poetry raya  vetto and the elf fauna two elf  children are also residing here in  elysia  and it turns out that these children a  boy and a girl  are the descendants of tethya and lyrt  now you may be asking yourself how is  that  even possible didn't tethya die during  the elf massacre  and wasn't her child killed with her 500  years later this same child was  reincarnated within yuno  so then how could tethya and licht still  have descendants  well as we learn in this chapter despite  being gravely injured  tethya survived the massacre furthermore  it is revealed that tethya had actually  been pregnant  with twins and after the massacre  one of those twins actually survived  sacred then has a flashback in which she  recalls that back when she found tethya  after the massacre tethya was indeed  still alive and so was one of the twins  inside her womb  secret then used her sealing magic to  close up all of tethya's wounds  but by the time that sacred woke up as  the bird narrow  many years had gone by and secretary had  no idea what happened to tethya  or her second baby all of this is a  massive revelation  the fact that direct descendants of  tethya and licht are still alive  in the present could be a huge  development  these children may have insane magical  talents  and potential and they could end up  playing an important role  in the black clover story at some point  in the future  this reveal will also inevitably lead to  speculation  about whether there are even more secret  descendants out there somewhere  and i'm 